  "description": "On a writable copy of the props fixture Field TP.Qty, named in TP's table ValidationRule ([Qty] < 1000) and carrying its own field ValidationRule, is renamed to Qty2 through Field.Name (Name and DBEngine.Errors read). The table ValidationRule is read through the held TableDef and through a fresh lookup, and the field's ValidationRule is read. Two INSERTs with dbFailOnError (Qty2 = 5000 and Qty2 = 5, Req = 'r') follow, with DBEngine.Errors; after Close and reopen the table's and the field's rules are read.",
